WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.635 --> 00:00:03.403
- BUT YOU CAN'T SAY
THE NAME OF THE CELEBRITY

00:00:03.437 --> 00:00:04.872
OR ANY PART OF THEIR NAME,
GOT IT?

00:00:04.905 --> 00:00:06.039
- YEAH.
- YEAH, WE GOT IT.

00:00:06.073 --> 00:00:07.774
- WE GOT IT.
- YOU ARE SO GONNA LOSE.

00:00:07.808 --> 00:00:09.042
- BABY, YOU ARE GOING DOWN.

00:00:09.076 --> 00:00:10.944
- WHY DON'T YOU START THE TIMER
AND BE AMAZED?

00:00:10.978 --> 00:00:14.081
- AND...GO.

00:00:14.114 --> 00:00:17.251
- OKAY, THIS GUY--
"E" EQUALS MC SQUARED.

00:00:17.284 --> 00:00:18.819
- ALBERT EINSTEIN.
- YES, THAT IS CORRECT.

00:00:18.852 --> 00:00:20.621
- WHAT?
EASY. HELLO?

00:00:20.654 --> 00:00:22.723
- OKAY, THIS IS THE TERMINATOR.

00:00:22.756 --> 00:00:24.291
- ARNOLD SCHWARZENEGGER!
- YEAH!

00:00:24.324 --> 00:00:25.792
OKAY, WE GOT--WE GOT--

00:00:25.826 --> 00:00:27.928
TALKING ABOUT, UH...
"ARE YOU TALKING TO ME?"

00:00:27.961 --> 00:00:30.430
- ROBERT DE NIRO!
- YEAH, YEAH, YEAH!

00:00:30.464 --> 00:00:31.932
ALL RIGHT.
ALL RIGHT.

00:00:31.965 --> 00:00:34.134
THIS PERSON PRETEND TO BE
STRAIGHT BUT HE'S REALLY GAY.

00:00:34.168 --> 00:00:35.302
- ME!

00:00:35.335 --> 00:00:37.938
[timer ticking]

00:00:40.741 --> 00:00:42.910
- UH, UH--
HE IS, UH--[clears throat]

00:00:42.943 --> 00:00:45.045
EXCUSE ME.
HE'S LIVING <i>LA VIDA LOCA.</i>

00:00:46.713 --> 00:00:47.714
- ME.

00:00:47.748 --> 00:00:48.815
- IT'S--
- NO.

00:00:48.849 --> 00:00:51.251
- OKAY.
- HE'S A, UM...

00:00:51.285 --> 00:00:52.786
LATIN POP STAR.

00:00:52.819 --> 00:00:54.855
- I'M NOT A LATIN POP STAR.

00:00:54.888 --> 00:00:55.856
- NO, YOU ARE NOT.

00:00:55.889 --> 00:00:57.491
IT'S NOT YOU.

00:00:57.524 --> 00:00:59.092
"HE BANGS, HE BANGS."

00:00:59.126 --> 00:01:00.494
- OH, RICKY MARTIN.

00:01:00.527 --> 00:01:02.396
- THAT IS CORRECT.

00:01:02.429 --> 00:01:03.897
- I WROTE THAT ONE TOO.

00:01:03.931 --> 00:01:05.232
[ding]

